<style>

    /* Etiqueta que embuelve la sección */
    .featured-units {
        padding: 32px 16px;
    }

    .featured-units-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .btn-link {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--primary-color);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
    }

    .featured-units-collection {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

</style>


{% comment %} Encabezado de la sección de productos destacados {% endcomment %}
<div class="featured-units-header">
    {% render 'heading-title', 
        title: section.settings.title,
        title_color: section.settings.title_color 
    %}
    <a href="{{ section.settings.btn_link }}" class="btn-link">
        {{ section.settings.btn_text }}
        <img src="{{ 'arrow-right-icon.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Arrow Right" width="12" height="12"/>
    </a>
</div>

{% comment %} Coleccion de productos destacados {% endcomment %}
{% comment %}
Usar un setting de tipo lista de productos, mostrar usado una etiqueta for y renderizar el snippet. https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/architecture/settings/input-settings#product_list
Usar bloques cuando sean requeridos: https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/architecture/blocks/section-blocks
Usar objeto producto: https://shopify.dev/docs/api/liquid/objects/product
{% endcomment %}
<div class="featured-units-collection">
    {% comment %} Card de producto destacado {% endcomment %}
    {%- if section.settings.product_list != blank -%}
        {% for product in section.settings.product_list %}
            {% render 'featured-product-card',
                product: product
            %}
        {% endfor %}
    {%- else -%}
        <p>No se han seleccionado productos aún.</p>
    {%- endif -%}

</div>


{% schema %}
{
    "name": "Featured Units",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "featured-units",
    "settings": [
        {
            "type": "product_list",
            "id": "product_list",
            "label": "Products",
            "limit": 12
        },
    ]
}
{% endschema %}